flowchart TD
    A[Scatter/Gather I/O] --> B[readv/writev]
    
    B --> C["struct iovec iov[3]"]
    C --> C1["iov[0].iov_base = buf1"]
    C --> C2["iov[0].iov_len = 100"]
    C --> C3["iov[1].iov_base = buf2"]
    C --> C4["iov[1].iov_len = 200"]
    C --> C5["iov[2].iov_base = buf3"]
    C --> C6["iov[2].iov_len = 150"]
    
    C --> D["ssize_t n = writev(fd, iov, 3)"]
    D --> E[Single System Call]
    E --> F[Writes 450 bytes total]
    
    G[Traditional Approach] --> G1["write(fd, buf1, 100)"]
    G1 --> G2["write(fd, buf2, 200)"]
    G2 --> G3["write(fd, buf3, 150)"]
    G3 --> H[Three System Calls - slow!]
    
    I[Benefits] --> I1[Fewer context switches]
    I --> I2[Atomic writes of scatter data]
    I --> I3[Better performance]
    
    style E fill:#e8f5e8
    style F fill:#d4edda
    style H fill:#ffe1e1
